            <ArticleTitle>An association between abo blood-group distribution and geographical differences in death-rates.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>295-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In England, Wales, and Scotland there is a strong association between mortality-rates and ABO blood-group distribution. It is suggested that some of the discrepancies in investigations of the relation between water hardness and mortality-rates from cardiovascular disease may be attributed to genetic influences.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
